        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/259028460?u=76c93f0df0fbeb4706736acca78f07a43e398a63&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h2 dir="auto">Summary</h2>
<p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #44502.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4690779347" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44502" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/44502/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44502">#44502</a>.</p>
<p dir="auto">This PR updates the CSS <code class="notranslate">random()</code> documentation to match the latest CSS Values &amp; Units Level 5 specification.</p>
<h2 dir="auto">What changed</h2>
<h3 dir="auto">Updated syntax examples</h3>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Replaced outdated examples with the current <code class="notranslate">random-key</code> syntax.</li>
<li>Updated examples to use:
<ul dir="auto">
<li><code class="notranslate">property-scoped</code></li>
<li><code class="notranslate">property-index-scoped</code></li>
<li><code class="notranslate">fixed &lt;number&gt;</code></li>
<li>custom <code class="notranslate">&lt;dashed-ident&gt;</code> combinations</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="auto">Updated parameter documentation</h3>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Renamed the optional first parameter to <code class="notranslate">&lt;random-key&gt;</code>.</li>
<li>Documented the current scope keywords:
<ul dir="auto">
<li><code class="notranslate">auto</code></li>
<li><code class="notranslate">element-scoped</code></li>
<li><code class="notranslate">property-scoped</code></li>
<li><code class="notranslate">property-index-scoped</code></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>Updated descriptions to match the current specification.</li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="auto">Updated description</h3>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Revised explanations of random base value sharing.</li>
<li>Updated examples showing:
<ul dir="auto">
<li><code class="notranslate">property-scoped</code></li>
<li>custom <code class="notranslate">&lt;dashed-ident&gt;</code></li>
<li><code class="notranslate">property-scoped</code> with custom keys</li>
<li>automatic behavior</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>Corrected terminology throughout the page.</li>
</ul>
<h2 dir="auto">Why</h2>
<p dir="auto">The CSS Values &amp; Units specification has evolved since this page was originally written.</p>
<p dir="auto">This update aligns the MDN documentation with the current editor's draft and removes outdated terminology and syntax.</p>
<h2 dir="auto">Verification</h2>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>✅ <code class="notranslate">npm test</code></li>
<li>✅ <code class="notranslate">npm run format</code></li>
<li>✅ Markdown lint passes</li>
<li>✅ Front matter validation passes</li>
<li>✅ Local MDN preview renders correctly</li>
<li>✅ Verified updated examples in local preview</li>
</ul>
